{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/FlatMap\/batch(strategy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5batch8strategyAA14AsyncSequencesO5BatchVy_xqd__Gqd___tAA0H8StrategyRd__ACQyd__ADRSlF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7FlatMapV","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"BatchSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/BatchSequence.swift#L221"},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"_Concurrency","symbolKind":"method","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"16.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"16.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"16.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"9.0"}],"role":"symbol","title":"batch(strategy:)","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV","text":"Batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Gathers elements into arrays and emits each array when the strategy says to flush."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/flatmap\/batch(strategy:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"strategy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV","text":"Batch","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Batch","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP","text":"BatchStrategy","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Strategy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP7ElementQa","text":"Element","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When to emit the gathered elements; its ","type":"text"},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence’s, inferred from the call.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"strategy"}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A sequence of the upstream’s elements, in order, in arrays of one or more.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The strategy decides when the pending elements are flushed: every so many elements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/count(_:)"},{"text":"), every interval","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/time(interval:clock:tolerance:)"},{"text":"), on a signal or a unit of work","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy"},{"text":"), whenever any of several does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/either(_:_:)"},{"text":"), or by a rule of your own (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy"},{"text":"). After every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flush, each strategy starts over. A flush with nothing pending emits nothing; the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence never emits an empty array.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When the upstream finishes, the pending elements, if any, are emitted as a last array and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sequence finishes. When the upstream throws, the pending elements are dropped and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence throws the same error. A signal that finishes stops firing while the batches go","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on; a signal that throws ends the sequence with its error.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The upstream and the strategy run in tasks of their own, started when iteration begins,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and arrays the consumer hasn’t taken yet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are buffered. Cancelling the consumer, or dropping its iterator, cancels both. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"upstream or signal that ignores cancellation keeps the internal task alive until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pending ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"next()"},{"text":" returns, and is not read again after that; the batched sequence itself","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends at once.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Batching needs iOS 16, Mac Catalyst 16, macOS 13, tvOS 16, watchOS 9 or visionOS 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"code":["for try await batch in [1, 2, 3, 4].async.batch(strategy: .either(.count(3), .time(interval: .seconds(1), clock: ContinuousClock()))) {","    print(batch) \/\/ Prints [1, 2, 3], then [4]","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Any error the upstream or the strategy throws.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Throws"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/FlatMap"]]},"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/SignalBatchStrategy":{"title":"SignalBatchStrategy","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SignalBatchStrategy","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy","abstract":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy"},{"text":" that flushes each time a sequence produces an element.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/signalbatchstrategy","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SignalBatchStrategy","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/BatchStrategy":{"title":"BatchStrategy","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BatchStrategy"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/batchstrategy","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","abstract":[{"text":"When ","ty